    <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p>
    <h1>Define the purpose.<br>Then handle the data.</h1>
    <p class="lead">The public product pages and creator preview do not require an account. Reservations and payments are currently closed.</p>
    <section><h2>Public pages</h2><p>You do not need to enter a name, address, or card details to browse the product pages. Fonts and visual assets are served from this site rather than requested from a third-party font provider. Access logs retained by the hosting platform for secure operation are governed by the hosting provider's operating terms.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Ideas and game demos</h2><p>If you use <a href="/create/">Create games</a>, we store the submission type, title, description, optional public demo/source links, receipt ID, review state, consent version, and submission time in the site's database for private review. There is no name, email, account, or payment field. Do not include private or sensitive details in your text or links. Submissions are not shown publicly or used to run third-party code on this site.</p><p>For abuse prevention, the site uses a daily one-way hash of your connection IP with a server-only secret and keeps the attempt counter briefly. The raw IP is not stored in the submission table. The receipt includes a separate removal code shown only after submission; we store only its hash. Enter both codes on the creator page to remove your submission from the review database. We keep submissions while they are under review unless you remove them, and may delete older material during maintenance. Hosting access logs follow the provider's operating terms.</p></section>
    <section><h2>avocadoPro purchase interest</h2><p>If you send a purchase interest request from <a href="https://avocadopro.si/#pro-interest">avocadopro.si</a>, we store your email address, optional region and note, chosen concept configuration, request ID, consent version, receipt state, and submission time for private product follow-up. This is not a purchase, reservation, payment, or agreement to a final price. We do not publish your request or send it to component vendors.</p><p>The receipt includes a removal code shown only to you; the database keeps its hash. You can remove your request with the receipt on the Pro page or ask us to delete it by email if you lose the code. For abuse prevention, a short-lived one-way hash of your connection IP is used for a daily attempt counter; the raw IP is not stored in the request table. Unneeded requests may be removed during maintenance. Hosting access logs follow the provider's operating terms.</p></section>
    <section><h2>After sales open</h2><p>If sales begin, we will handle only the information needed to process an order, such as the order number, product, amount, accepted terms version, timestamp, payment state, and external payment identifier. Card details will be processed by an external payment provider and will not be stored in this site's order database.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>The legal operator is AVOKADO LLC; its filing information is published in <a href="/legal/#company-information">Company information</a>. Questions about the current project can be sent to <a href="mailto:kirin.999@icloud.com">kirin.999@icloud.com</a> or <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kirin.41/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram @kirin.41</a>. The seller address and phone number will be published before sales open.</p></section>
